    "description": "Tyrannicide Push Dagger (Rev. 1): Laffs Dynamics\n\nRevised design of the original Tyrannicide Push Dagger.\n\n\nRev. 1: Altered blade geometry; lengthened by 13mm, repositioned gut barb, slightly thinned from prior model.\n\n\n\nPrinter Used: Ender 3 V2\n\nFilament Used: PLA+\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nExtruder: 218C \nBed: 56C \nFirst Layer Print Height: .2mm \nStandard Layer Height: .12mm\nWall Thickness: .40 \nWall Perimeters: 8+\nInfill: 75%+\n\n\nSpec changed for all push daggers moving forward (Prior models will be updates with listed new specs.) include:\n\n*Thinner blade stem.\n\n*Slightly wider grip.\n\n*Flatter cross section contour to reduce hotspots of the blade stem between fingers.\n\n*Solid grip in place of prior skeletonized grip.\n\n*Updated print settings to offset thinner blade stem to preserve structural integrity.\n\n\nCredits: \n\nNotsogod: Printed the revised design, sent images of both model variants.",
